1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,263
I have a degree and still no job. What do I do now?

2
00:00:03,563 --> 00:00:07,837
Arre Raju, the whole country runs on chai. Open a tea stall!

3
00:00:08,137 --> 00:00:10,047
Does anyone get rich selling tea, Chacha?

4
00:00:10,347 --> 00:00:16,150
You can start with ₹20,000. A stall, gas, utensils and good tea leaves.

5
00:00:16,450 --> 00:00:21,407
Set up outside a college, office or hospital. The crowd there never ends.

6
00:00:21,957 --> 00:00:25,121
Bhaiya, one cutting chai and two biscuits!

7
00:00:25,421 --> 00:00:28,900
Here you go, madam, special ginger chai. Just ₹15.

8
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:34,910
Two hundred cups a day is about ₹1,500 profit every day.

9
00:00:35,210 --> 00:00:39,944
Keep samosas, biscuits and bun maska too. They earn more than the chai.

10
00:00:40,244 --> 00:00:42,558
Forty thousand a month! Raju's life is set!
